{"seq":3,"slug":"event-system","title":"事件系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/event-system","wordCount":904,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件系统\">事件系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件系统是 Unity 开发中实现模块间松耦合通信的核心机制。在游戏开发中，角色受伤需要通知 UI 更新血条、音效系统播放受击音、相机执行震动效果——这些系统之间不应直接引用彼此。事件系统通过&quot;发布-订阅&quot;模式让发送方和接收方完全解耦，提升代码的可维护性和可扩展性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 事件通信模式&#10;        A[事件发布者] --&gt;|触发事件| B[事件总线/委托]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| C[订阅者 A - UI 系统]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| D[订阅者 B - 音效系统]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| E[订阅者 C - 特效系统]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| F[订阅者 D - 成就系统]&#10;    end&#10;    G[直接引用模式] -.-&gt;|紧耦合| H[维护困难]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|松耦合| I[易扩展]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 事件通信模式\n        A[事件发布者] --&gt;|触发事件| B[事件总线/委托]\n        B --&gt;|通知| C[订阅者 A - UI 系统]\n        B --&gt;|通知| D[订阅者 B - 音效系统]\n        B --&gt;|通知| E[订阅者 C - 特效系统]\n        B --&gt;|通知| F[订阅者 D - 成就系统]\n    end\n    G[直接引用模式] -.-&gt;|紧耦合| H[维护困难]\n    A -.-&gt;|松耦合| I[易扩展]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件方案</th>\n<th>类型安全</th>\n<th>解耦程度</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>调试难度</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C# delegate/event</td>\n<td>强类型</td>\n<td>组件级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>同对象/直接引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UnityEvent</td>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>组件级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（Inspector 可见）</td>\n<td>设计师配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态事件总线</td>\n<td>强类型</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>跨系统通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ScriptableObject 事件</td>\n<td>强类型</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（资源可见）</td>\n<td>跨场景通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unity 消息系统</td>\n<td>无类型</td>\n<td>组件级</td>\n<td>低（反射）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>简单原型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"c-委托与-event-关键字\">C# 委托与 event 关键字</h2><p>C# 的 <code>delegate</code> 和 <code>event</code> 关键字是 Unity 事件系统的底层基础。delegate 定义方法签名类型，event 关键字在此基础上添加了访问限制——外部只能订阅/取消订阅，不能直接调用或赋值，防止意外覆盖其他订阅者。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System;&#10;&#10;public class HealthSystem : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    public event Action&lt;float, float&gt; OnHealthChanged;&#10;    public event Action OnDeath;&#10;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float maxHealth = 100f;&#10;    private float currentHealth;&#10;&#10;    public float CurrentHealth =&gt; currentHealth;&#10;    public float MaxHealth =&gt; maxHealth;&#10;    public float HealthPercent =&gt; currentHealth / maxHealth;&#10;&#10;    private void Awake()&#10;    {&#10;        currentHealth = maxHealth;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void TakeDamage(float damage)&#10;    {&#10;        if (currentHealth &lt;= 0f) return;&#10;&#10;        currentHealth = Mathf.Max(0f, currentHealth - damage);&#10;        OnHealthChanged?.Invoke(currentHealth, maxHealth);&#10;&#10;        if (currentHealth &lt;= 0f)&#10;        {&#10;            OnDeath?.Invoke();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Heal(float amount)&#10;    {&#10;        if (currentHealth &lt;= 0f) return;&#10;&#10;        currentHealth = Mathf.Min(maxHealth, currentHealth + amount);&#10;        OnHealthChanged?.Invoke(currentHealth, maxHealth);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class HealthSystem : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public event Action&#x3C;float, float> OnHealthChanged;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public event Action OnDeath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float maxHealth = 100f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float currentHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float CurrentHealth => currentHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float MaxHealth => maxHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float HealthPercent => currentHealth / maxHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Awake()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = maxHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TakeDamage(float damage)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentHealth &#x3C;= 0f) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = Mathf.Max(0f, currentHealth - damage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OnHealthChanged?.Invoke(currentHealth, maxHealth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentHealth &#x3C;= 0f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            OnDeath?.Invoke();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Heal(float amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentHealth &#x3C;= 0f) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = Mathf.Min(maxHealth, currentHealth + amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OnHealthChanged?.Invoke(currentHealth, maxHealth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>订阅者通过 <code>+=</code> 和 <code>-=</code> 操作符注册和注销回调。必须在 OnDisable 或 OnDestroy 中取消订阅，否则会因为引用残留导致空引用异常或内存泄漏：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UI;&#10;&#10;public class HealthBarUI : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private HealthSystem healthSystem;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Slider healthSlider;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Image fillImage;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Color healthyColor = Color.green;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Color criticalColor = Color.red;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        healthSystem.OnHealthChanged += UpdateHealthBar;&#10;        healthSystem.OnDeath += HandleDeath;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        healthSystem.OnHealthChanged -= UpdateHealthBar;&#10;        healthSystem.OnDeath -= HandleDeath;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void UpdateHealthBar(float current, float max)&#10;    {&#10;        float percent = current / max;&#10;        healthSlider.value = percent;&#10;        fillImage.color = Color.Lerp(criticalColor, healthyColor, percent);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void HandleDeath()&#10;    {&#10;        gameObject.SetActive(false);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class HealthBarUI : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private HealthSystem healthSystem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Slider healthSlider;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Image fillImage;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Color healthyColor = Color.green;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Color criticalColor = Color.red;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        healthSystem.OnHealthChanged += UpdateHealthBar;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        healthSystem.OnDeath += HandleDeath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        healthSystem.OnHealthChanged -= UpdateHealthBar;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        healthSystem.OnDeath -= HandleDeath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void UpdateHealthBar(float current, float max)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float percent = current / max;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        healthSlider.value = percent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fillImage.color = Color.Lerp(criticalColor, healthyColor, percent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void HandleDeath()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gameObject.SetActive(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"unityevent-与-inspector-绑定\">UnityEvent 与 Inspector 绑定</h2><p>UnityEvent 是 Unity 对 C# 事件的封装，最大的优势在于可以在 Inspector 面板中直接配置事件响应，让设计师无需修改代码即可调整事件行为。UnityEvent 支持序列化，可以保存在预制体和场景中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.Events;&#10;&#10;[System.Serializable]&#10;public class DamageEvent : UnityEvent&lt;float, Vector3&gt; { }&#10;&#10;public class InteractableObject : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [Header(&quot;交互事件&quot;)]&#10;    [SerializeField] private UnityEvent onInteractStart;&#10;    [SerializeField] private UnityEvent onInteractEnd;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;伤害事件&quot;)]&#10;    [SerializeField] private DamageEvent onDamageReceived;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;交互设置&quot;)]&#10;    [SerializeField] private float interactRange = 2f;&#10;    [SerializeField] private KeyCode interactKey = KeyCode.E;&#10;&#10;    private bool isInteracting;&#10;&#10;    public void OnPlayerEnterRange()&#10;    {&#10;        if (Input.GetKeyDown(interactKey) &amp;&amp; !isInteracting)&#10;        {&#10;            isInteracting = true;&#10;            onInteractStart?.Invoke();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ReceiveDamage(float damage, Vector3 hitPoint)&#10;    {&#10;        onDamageReceived?.Invoke(damage, hitPoint);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void EndInteraction()&#10;    {&#10;        if (isInteracting)&#10;        {&#10;            isInteracting = false;&#10;            onInteractEnd?.Invoke();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.Events;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[System.Serializable]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class DamageEvent : UnityEvent&#x3C;float, Vector3> { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class InteractableObject : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"交互事件\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private UnityEvent onInteractStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private UnityEvent onInteractEnd;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"伤害事件\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private DamageEvent onDamageReceived;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"交互设置\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float interactRange = 2f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private KeyCode interactKey = KeyCode.E;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool isInteracting;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnPlayerEnterRange()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Input.GetKeyDown(interactKey) &#x26;&#x26; !isInteracting)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isInteracting = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onInteractStart?.Invoke();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ReceiveDamage(float damage, Vector3 hitPoint)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onDamageReceived?.Invoke(damage, hitPoint);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void EndInteraction()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (isInteracting)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isInteracting = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onInteractEnd?.Invoke();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>C# event</th>\n<th>UnityEvent</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Inspector 配置</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持拖拽绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型参数</td>\n<td>最多 16 个</td>\n<td>最多 4 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时性能</td>\n<td>高（直接委托调用）</td>\n<td>中（反射 + 序列化开销）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译时类型检查</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>Inspector 绑定无编译检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>程序员间通信</td>\n<td>设计师配置驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"静态事件总线架构\">静态事件总线架构</h2><p>静态事件总线是大型项目中最常用的全局事件通信方案。通过静态类持有事件实例，任何脚本都可以发布和订阅事件，无需持有对方引用。结合泛型可以构建类型安全的事件系统。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using System;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;&#10;public static class EventBus&lt;T&gt; where T : struct&#10;{&#10;    private static readonly HashSet&lt;Action&lt;T&gt;&gt; listeners = new();&#10;&#10;    public static void Register(Action&lt;T&gt; handler)&#10;    {&#10;        listeners.Add(handler);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static void Unregister(Action&lt;T&gt; handler)&#10;    {&#10;        listeners.Remove(handler);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static void Raise(T eventData)&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var listener in listeners)&#10;        {&#10;            listener.Invoke(eventData);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static void Clear()&#10;    {&#10;        listeners.Clear();&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public struct DamageDealtEvent&#10;{&#10;    public float Damage;&#10;    public UnityEngine.Vector3 HitPoint;&#10;    public UnityEngine.GameObject Source;&#10;    public UnityEngine.GameObject Target;&#10;}&#10;&#10;public struct EnemyKilledEvent&#10;{&#10;    public UnityEngine.GameObject Enemy;&#10;    public int ScoreValue;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using System;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public static class EventBus&#x3C;T> where T : struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly HashSet&#x3C;Action&#x3C;T>> listeners = new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static void Register(Action&#x3C;T> handler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listeners.Add(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static void Unregister(Action&#x3C;T> handler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listeners.Remove(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static void Raise(T eventData)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var listener in listeners)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            listener.Invoke(eventData);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static void Clear()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listeners.Clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public struct DamageDealtEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float Damage;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public UnityEngine.Vector3 HitPoint;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public UnityEngine.GameObject Source;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public UnityEngine.GameObject Target;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public struct EnemyKilledEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public UnityEngine.GameObject Enemy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int ScoreValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 事件总线通信流&#10;        A[战斗系统] --&gt;|Raise DamageDealtEvent| B[EventBus]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| C[UI 血条]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| D[伤害数字]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| E[受击音效]&#10;        B --&gt;|通知| F[统计系统]&#10;    end&#10;    G[敌人 AI] --&gt;|Raise EnemyKilledEvent| B\">graph LR\n    subgraph 事件总线通信流\n        A[战斗系统] --&gt;|Raise DamageDealtEvent| B[EventBus]\n        B --&gt;|通知| C[UI 血条]\n        B --&gt;|通知| D[伤害数字]\n        B --&gt;|通知| E[受击音效]\n        B --&gt;|通知| F[统计系统]\n    end\n    G[敌人 AI] --&gt;|Raise EnemyKilledEvent| B</pre><p>使用事件总线时，各系统只需订阅关心的事件类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class DamageNumberSpawner : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private GameObject damageNumberPrefab;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        EventBus&lt;DamageDealtEvent&gt;.Register(OnDamageDealt);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        EventBus&lt;DamageDealtEvent&gt;.Unregister(OnDamageDealt);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDamageDealt(DamageDealtEvent evt)&#10;    {&#10;        var go = Instantiate(damageNumberPrefab, evt.HitPoint, Quaternion.identity);&#10;        go.GetComponent&lt;DamageNumber&gt;().Setup(evt.Damage);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class ScoreManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private int totalScore;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        EventBus&lt;EnemyKilledEvent&gt;.Register(OnEnemyKilled);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        EventBus&lt;EnemyKilledEvent&gt;.Unregister(OnEnemyKilled);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnemyKilled(EnemyKilledEvent evt)&#10;    {&#10;        totalScore += evt.ScoreValue;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class DamageNumberSpawner : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private GameObject damageNumberPrefab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EventBus&#x3C;DamageDealtEvent>.Register(OnDamageDealt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EventBus&#x3C;DamageDealtEvent>.Unregister(OnDamageDealt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDamageDealt(DamageDealtEvent evt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var go = Instantiate(damageNumberPrefab, evt.HitPoint, Quaternion.identity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        go.GetComponent&#x3C;DamageNumber>().Setup(evt.Damage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ScoreManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int totalScore;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EventBus&#x3C;EnemyKilledEvent>.Register(OnEnemyKilled);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EventBus&#x3C;EnemyKilledEvent>.Unregister(OnEnemyKilled);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnemyKilled(EnemyKilledEvent evt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        totalScore += evt.ScoreValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"scriptableobject-事件通道\">ScriptableObject 事件通道</h2><p>ScriptableObject 事件通道（Event Channel）将事件定义为可持久化的资源文件，结合了静态事件总线的解耦能力和 UnityEvent 的可视化优势。事件通道在 Inspector 中可见，支持跨场景引用，是 Unity 官方推荐的事件架构模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;using System;&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;Events/Void Event Channel&quot;)]&#10;public class VoidEventChannel : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    private readonly HashSet&lt;Action&gt; listeners = new();&#10;&#10;    public void Register(Action handler)&#10;    {&#10;        listeners.Add(handler);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Unregister(Action handler)&#10;    {&#10;        listeners.Remove(handler);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Raise()&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var listener in listeners)&#10;        {&#10;            listener.Invoke();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;Events/Float Event Channel&quot;)]&#10;public class FloatEventChannel : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    private readonly HashSet&lt;Action&lt;float&gt;&gt; listeners = new();&#10;&#10;    public void Register(Action&lt;float&gt; handler)&#10;    {&#10;        listeners.Add(handler);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Unregister(Action&lt;float&gt; handler)&#10;    {&#10;        listeners.Remove(handler);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Raise(float value)&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var listener in listeners)&#10;        {&#10;            listener.Invoke(value);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Events/Void Event Channel\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class VoidEventChannel : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly HashSet&#x3C;Action> listeners = new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Register(Action handler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listeners.Add(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Unregister(Action handler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listeners.Remove(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Raise()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var listener in listeners)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            listener.Invoke();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Events/Float Event Channel\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class FloatEventChannel : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly HashSet&#x3C;Action&#x3C;float>> listeners = new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Register(Action&#x3C;float> handler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listeners.Add(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Unregister(Action&#x3C;float> handler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listeners.Remove(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Raise(float value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var listener in listeners)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            listener.Invoke(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>发布者和订阅者通过 Inspector 拖拽同一个 ScriptableObject 资源来建立连接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class PlayerHealth : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private FloatEventChannel onHealthChanged;&#10;    [SerializeField] private VoidEventChannel onPlayerDeath;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float maxHealth = 100f;&#10;&#10;    private float currentHealth;&#10;&#10;    private void Awake()&#10;    {&#10;        currentHealth = maxHealth;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void TakeDamage(float damage)&#10;    {&#10;        currentHealth = Mathf.Max(0f, currentHealth - damage);&#10;        onHealthChanged.Raise(currentHealth / maxHealth);&#10;&#10;        if (currentHealth &lt;= 0f)&#10;        {&#10;            onPlayerDeath.Raise();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class GameOverScreen : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private VoidEventChannel onPlayerDeath;&#10;    [SerializeField] private GameObject gameOverPanel;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        onPlayerDeath.Register(ShowGameOver);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        onPlayerDeath.Unregister(ShowGameOver);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void ShowGameOver()&#10;    {&#10;        gameOverPanel.SetActive(true);&#10;        Time.timeScale = 0f;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PlayerHealth : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private FloatEventChannel onHealthChanged;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private VoidEventChannel onPlayerDeath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float maxHealth = 100f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float currentHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Awake()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = maxHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TakeDamage(float damage)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = Mathf.Max(0f, currentHealth - damage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onHealthChanged.Raise(currentHealth / maxHealth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentHealth &#x3C;= 0f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onPlayerDeath.Raise();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class GameOverScreen : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private VoidEventChannel onPlayerDeath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private GameObject gameOverPanel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onPlayerDeath.Register(ShowGameOver);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onPlayerDeath.Unregister(ShowGameOver);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void ShowGameOver()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gameOverPanel.SetActive(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Time.timeScale = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph ScriptableObject 事件通道&#10;        A[FloatEventChannel 资源] --&gt;|Inspector 引用| B[PlayerHealth 发布者]&#10;        A --&gt;|Inspector 引用| C[HealthBarUI 订阅者]&#10;        A --&gt;|Inspector 引用| D[SoundManager 订阅者]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt;|Raise| A&#10;    A --&gt;|通知| C&#10;    A --&gt;|通知| D\">graph TD\n    subgraph ScriptableObject 事件通道\n        A[FloatEventChannel 资源] --&gt;|Inspector 引用| B[PlayerHealth 发布者]\n        A --&gt;|Inspector 引用| C[HealthBarUI 订阅者]\n        A --&gt;|Inspector 引用| D[SoundManager 订阅者]\n    end\n    B --&gt;|Raise| A\n    A --&gt;|通知| C\n    A --&gt;|通知| D</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((事件系统))&#10;    C# delegate/event&#10;      强类型安全&#10;      高性能直接调用&#10;      OnEnable/OnDisable 管理&#10;    UnityEvent&#10;      Inspector 拖拽绑定&#10;      序列化持久化&#10;      设计师友好&#10;    静态事件总线&#10;      泛型类型安全&#10;      全局解耦通信&#10;      HashSet 注册管理&#10;    SO 事件通道&#10;      资源文件可视化&#10;      跨场景引用&#10;      官方推荐模式\">mindmap\n  root((事件系统))\n    C# delegate/event\n      强类型安全\n      高性能直接调用\n      OnEnable/OnDisable 管理\n    UnityEvent\n      Inspector 拖拽绑定\n      序列化持久化\n      设计师友好\n    静态事件总线\n      泛型类型安全\n      全局解耦通信\n      HashSet 注册管理\n    SO 事件通道\n      资源文件可视化\n      跨场景引用\n      官方推荐模式</pre><ul>\n<li>C# delegate/event 是事件系统的基础，提供强类型安全和高性能的组件级通信</li>\n<li>UnityEvent 支持 Inspector 序列化绑定，适合设计师配置驱动的事件响应</li>\n<li>静态事件总线通过泛型实现类型安全的全局事件广播，适合大型项目跨系统通信</li>\n<li>ScriptableObject 事件通道结合了解耦能力和可视化优势，是官方推荐的事件架构</li>\n<li>所有事件订阅必须在 OnDisable/OnDestroy 中取消，防止空引用异常和内存泄漏</li>\n<li>根据项目规模和团队组成选择合适的事件方案，小项目用 delegate，大项目用事件总线或 SO 通道</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事件系统","id":"事件系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"C# 委托与 event 关键字","id":"c-委托与-event-关键字"},{"level":2,"text":"UnityEvent 与 Inspector 绑定","id":"unityevent-与-inspector-绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"静态事件总线架构","id":"静态事件总线架构"},{"level":2,"text":"ScriptableObject 事件通道","id":"scriptableobject-事件通道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协程与异步编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/coroutine-and-async"},"next":{"title":"ScriptableObject 数据架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/scriptable-objects"}}